	by giant molecular clouds, processes that preferentially affect
	low-mass clusters and cause a turnover in the cluster mass
	function to appear on ∼1--10-Gyr timescales. ▪ Even after
	dispersal, some clusters remain coherent and thus detectable in
	chemical or action space for multiple galactic orbits. In the
	next decade, a new generation of space-- and adaptive
